    "Namespace inspection uses the canonical std.foundation/ns-* functions; only std.foundation/env-snapshot and std.foundation/env-module remain as environment wrappers, while :env/* snapshot keys remain unchanged. No runtime-* or sandbox lifecycle duplicates are added to std.foundation."}
